      "duration": "10 minutes/level",
      "rulesText": "Resistance reduces each instance of the chosen energy damage, including damage to equipment; side effects may remain. Same-energy resistances overlap, never add. Protection from Energy absorbs damage before this spell is used, until its pool is exhausted.",
