    {
      "id": "npc-effect.rage",
      "name": "Rage (Core barbarian)",
      "catalogStatus": "resolved",
      "kind": "class-ability",
      "duration": "While raging; daily rounds tracked separately",
      "rulesText": "Core barbarian Rage, not Unchained Rage or the rage spell. Morale Strength/Constitution +4 (+6 at barbarian 11, +8 at 20); morale Will +2/+3/+4; AC and CMD -2. Constitution raises HP, not temporary HP: the added HP disappear when rage ends. Free action to start/end; cannot start fatigued/exhausted; unconsciousness ends rage. Fatigued afterward for twice the rounds spent raging unless Tireless Rage (barbarian 17). Temporary Constitution does not grant more daily rage rounds. At barbarian 14, Indomitable Will adds +4 against enchantment spells while raging, stacking with other bonuses. The profile asserts this NPC has legally acquired the selected source-level Rage; it does not grant barbarian features.",
      "parameters": [],
      "tiers": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "modifiers": [
